  description: "If you Special Summon any of these monsters using a Pendulum Monster(s)
    as material, while this card is already face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone: You
    can activate the appropriate effect. You cannot apply that same effect of \"Pendulum
    Dimension\" for the rest of this turn (even if this card leaves the field).\r\n\u25CF
    Fusion: Special Summon 1 monster from your Deck with the same original Level
    as that Fusion Monster, in Defense Position, but negate its effects.\r\n\u25CF
    Synchro: Add 1 \"Polymerization\" from your Deck to your hand.\r\n\u25CF Xyz:
    Take 1 Tuner from your Deck with an equal or lower Level than that Xyz Monster's
    Rank, and add it to your hand or Special Summon it."
